    {
      "v": 7,
      "zh": "耶 和 華 卻 因 自 己 與 大 衛 所 立 的 約 ， 不 肯 滅 大 衛 的 家 ， 照 他 所 應 許 的 ， 永 遠 賜 燈 光 與 大 衛 和 他 的 子 孫 。",
      "en": "But the Lord was unwilling to destroy David’s dynasty[NOTE:1] because of the promise[NOTE:2] he had made to give David a perpetual dynasty.[NOTE:3]",
      "notes": [
        "Or “covenant.”",
        "Heb “which he made to David, just as he had promised to give him and his sons a lamp all the days.” Here “lamp” is metaphorical, symbolizing the Davidic dynasty.",
